direction: down
title: "C23 RC retirement: node grace differs from domain grace"
"Source owner" -> "RC domain gate": "close lookup before header load; drain acquired references"
"RC domain gate" -> "Slot-release receipt": "last zero + unlink + synchronous scan grace; alias closure"
"Slot-release receipt" -> "Origin release service": "single-use StorageId/generation; reserved independent record"
"Origin release service" -> "Native free": "retain original allocator family and provider"
"Native free" -> "Unknown custody": "no blind retry; no payload dereference"
"Native free" -> "Origin retirement": "authoritative completion, not physical-effect inference"
"Root task readers" -> "Domain retirement": "pre-claim readers and descendants drained; separate permit"
